	"notice": "Original 37-key MiniFreak, distinct from MiniFreak 49. Use the MIDI endpoint for notes and clock; preset/software communication may use a different endpoint. Audio is separate from USB MIDI. Physical controls and keys remain unbound because presets, modes and octave settings determine messages. Diagrams are selected-control schematics, not dimensioned panel drawings. Port names are recorded only when documented; otherwise detection uses an unambiguous complete model name or manual selection.",
